* The Rankin step at S = 1 + 1 / log Y (Lean sum_bvA_sq_div_le_tsum, for any real summand C): n <= Y gives 1 / n <= e n ^c -u S, since n ^c ( 1 / log Y ) <= Y ^c ( 1 / log Y ) = e (isumless).

